q{<strong>HK "maybe" expects exactly one chase.</strong> The follow-up is not pushy — it is the second half of the protocol.},
q{<strong>Mainland weight-per-word cuts both ways.</strong> When they say yes, it is a real yes — and your own words gain weight too, so spend them carefully.},
q{<strong>Confirm high stakes in plain words.</strong> "Just to confirm: Thursday" — the one sentence no register misreads.},
],
