{ t => 'Run the audit', p => 'Pick five colleagues. For each: current rung, and the receipt — the specific thing you gave that made it possible. Flag any rung with no receipt.', a => q{The no-receipt flag is the plan for next month: one useful artifact per flag. The audit is not a guilt exercise — it is a to-do list generator for giving.} },
{ t => 'Design one rung-up', p => 'For one chat-level relationship, design the context step: what useful thing could you produce for them this month that they would actually use?', a => q{The usefulness test: would it save them tickets, minutes or risk? "A glossary of your domain\'s acronyms" saved Mei\'s team arguments — usefulness at that scale is climbable by anyone in a month.} },
{ t => 'Watch for advocacy', p => 'Notice one time someone cited your work in a room you were not in. Write the one-line thank-you that names what made it possible — without asking for more.', a => q{Model: "Heard you walked the risk review through the calendar of pain — glad it earned its keep on your side too." Thanks that name the mechanism compound; thanks that angle for the next favour deflate.} },
],
